Improper Input Validation The regex input is user-controlled and may lead to Denial of Service (DoS) or other unexpected behavior if not properly validated., Path Traversal Vulnerability The directory input is user-controlled and could allow an attacker to access files outside the intended directory if not properly sanitized.

